-- Foreground child creation. An unnamed, non-inheritable job is configured
-- before CreateProcessW and attached atomically through JOB_LIST (0x2000d).
-- HANDLE_LIST contains only three temporary inheritable stream duplicates.
-- No CREATE_NO_WINDOW, CREATE_NEW_PROCESS_GROUP or breakaway flag is used.
-- STARTUPINFOEXW: cb 0, flags 60, handles 80/88/96, attributes 104.
-- Workspace: attribute-size cell 112, PROCESS_INFORMATION 128..151.
-- The caller owns at least 136 aligned bytes; its job handle is at 128.
import "windows_process_managed.ouro";

